  "summary": "Traditional Chinese kites from Weifang featuring elaborate designs, structural innovation, and artistic craftsmanship.",
  "description": "Weifang kites are characterized by their structural sophistication, often featuring multiple line controls for complex maneuvers, and artistic designs depicting animals, mythical creatures, and historical figures. Developed over centuries in Shandong province, these kites combine aerodynamic engineering with artistic expression, with different schools developing distinctive styles and techniques.",
